{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravebound -</strong>\u00a0the post-apocalyptic extraction shooter where humanity\u2019s biggest mistake wasn\u2019t nuclear war\u2026 it was giving your toaster Wi-Fi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth\u2019s gone to scrap. The robots have lost their marbles. And now the world\u2019s most \u201chelpful\u201d home appliances are packing heat and picking fights. From microwave snipers to fridge tanks and kamikaze toasters \u2014 they all want you <i>unplugged</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load in solo or with your most questionable friends, scavenge for loot, and fight your way through the mechanical madness. Grab glowing <strong>crystals</strong> to power up your gear, then make a run for the exit before you get saut\u00e9ed by a blender with a bad attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a gamble: <strong>extract and keep your loot, or dive deeper for bigger rewards (and even angrier appliances).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Making this Mess Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Chaotic Extraction Gameplay</strong><br>Drop in solo or with a squad, blast through junkyard robots, and fight to escape before your own coffee maker finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- A.I. Appliances Gone Mad</strong><br>They used to serve breakfast. Now they serve bullets. Expect absurd mechanical enemies with personalities as broken as their circuitry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Comic-Book Wasteland</strong><br>Explore crumbling cities and overgrown ruins in bright, stylized chaos \u2014 where the apocalypse looks <i>weirdly fun</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- PvPvE Combat</strong><br>You\u2019re not alone. Battle other players and their equally doomed ambitions while dodging a vacuum cleaner with trust issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Loot, Upgrade, Repeat</strong><br>Collect rare power crystals to upgrade your guns, gadgets, and dignity (if any remains).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Risk vs. Reward</strong><br>Extract your loot early or stay for the big score. Just remember: in <i>Gravebound</i>, dying means losing everything\u2026 including your pride.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3613050?t=1773062172","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/caa9783e984ff52955574592d926b4ece0bed58c/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773062172","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/1df829941a11d28dc2740d81a2fde511e230a127/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773062172","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/1df829941a11d28dc2740d81a2fde511e230a127/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773062172","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>About the Game</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gravebound -</strong>\u00a0the post-apocalyptic extraction shooter where humanity\u2019s biggest mistake wasn\u2019t nuclear war\u2026 it was giving your toaster Wi-Fi.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Earth\u2019s gone to scrap. The robots have lost their marbles. And now the world\u2019s most \u201chelpful\u201d home appliances are packing heat and picking fights. From microwave snipers to fridge tanks and kamikaze toasters \u2014 they all want you <i>unplugged</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Load in solo or with your most questionable friends, scavenge for loot, and fight your way through the mechanical madness. Grab glowing <strong>crystals</strong> to power up your gear, then make a run for the exit before you get saut\u00e9ed by a blender with a bad attitude.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is a gamble: <strong>extract and keep your loot, or dive deeper for bigger rewards (and even angrier appliances).</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Making this Mess Fun</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Chaotic Extraction Gameplay</strong><br>Drop in solo or with a squad, blast through junkyard robots, and fight to escape before your own coffee maker finds you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- A.I. Appliances Gone Mad</strong><br>They used to serve breakfast. Now they serve bullets. Expect absurd mechanical enemies with personalities as broken as their circuitry.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Comic-Book Wasteland</strong><br>Explore crumbling cities and overgrown ruins in bright, stylized chaos \u2014 where the apocalypse looks <i>weirdly fun</i>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- PvPvE Combat</strong><br>You\u2019re not alone. Battle other players and their equally doomed ambitions while dodging a vacuum cleaner with trust issues.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Loot, Upgrade, Repeat</strong><br>Collect rare power crystals to upgrade your guns, gadgets, and dignity (if any remains).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>- Risk vs. Reward</strong><br>Extract your loot early or stay for the big score. Just remember: in <i>Gravebound</i>, dying means losing everything\u2026 including your pride.</p>","developers":["Crater Studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3613050/a2a461b70a568137cd5d68540b419f93d7462d43/header.jpg?t=1773062172","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul